{%- comment -%}
  Các phần chép từ mẫu Kinh cho template product.win-win (theme win win):
  - Ẩn khung WhatsApp gốc của cod-form, thay bằng khung: Entrega 3-5 días + Confirmación 24-72 h (WhatsApp o teléfono)
  - Ghi chú "Envío solo a la España peninsular"
  - 4 ô màu bằng nhau: Confirmación por WhatsApp / Pago contra reembolso / Comprueba el paquete / Soporte por email
  - "Detalles del producto" (MỞ SẴN) hiện thông tin sản phẩm
  Không gọi các snippet xophia-*, nên sửa ở đây không ảnh hưởng mẫu Kinh.
  Tùy từng sản phẩm:
  - "Detalles del producto": nếu sản phẩm có metafield custom.nt_info thì hiện nó, không có thì hiện mô tả thường.
  - Tắt ghi chú vùng giao hàng: đặt metafield custom.nt_hide_region = true.
  Dùng: {% render 'nt-kinh-parts', product: product %}
{%- endcomment -%}
<style>
  /* Khung nhắc WhatsApp gốc trong cod-form (snippet dùng chung) bị ẩn ở win-win, thay bằng .ntk-info bên dưới */
  cod-form .cod-whatsapp { display: none !important; }
  .ntk-info { display: grid; gap: 8px; margin: 12px 0 0; padding: 12px 14px; border: 1px solid rgba(30, 58, 95, .18); border-radius: 12px; background: #fdfbf7; }
  .ntk-info p { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; margin: 0; color: #1a1a1a; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.45; }
  .ntk-info svg { width: 20px; height: 20px; flex: none; margin-top: 1px; fill: none; stroke: #1e3a5f; stroke-width: 1.8; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; }
  .ntk-info strong { color: #1e3a5f; }

  .ntk-region { margin: 14px 0 0; padding: 12px 14px; border-left: 3px solid #1e3a5f; background: #fdfbf7; color: #4a4a4a; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.55; }
  .ntk-region strong { color: #1e3a5f; }

  /* 4 ô cam kết: 2x2, cùng kích thước, mỗi ô 1 màu nhẹ */
  .ntk-assure { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); grid-auto-rows: 1fr; gap: 10px; margin: 16px 0 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
  .ntk-assure li {
    --c: #1e3a5f; --bg: #f3f6fb; --bd: #dbe4f0;
    display: flex; flex-direction: row; align-items: center; justify-content: flex-start; gap: 10px;
    min-width: 0; min-height: 68px; margin: 0; padding: 12px; box-sizing: border-box;
    background: var(--bg); border: 1px solid var(--bd); border-left: 4px solid var(--c); border-radius: 12px;
    color: #1a1a1a; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.25; text-align: left;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(26, 26, 26, .04);
  }
  .ntk-assure__ico { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 38px; height: 38px; flex: none; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--c); box-shadow: 0 4px 10px color-mix(in srgb, var(--c) 35%, transparent); }
  .ntk-assure__ico svg { width: 20px; height: 20px; fill: none; stroke: #fff; stroke-width: 1.9; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; }
  .ntk-assure__txt { display: block; min-width: 0; color: #1a1a1a; }
  .ntk-assure__txt small { display: block; margin-top: 2px; color: var(--c); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; }
  .ntk-assure .is-wa { --c: #1a9a52; --bg: #effaf3; --bd: #cdebd8; }
  .ntk-assure .is-cod { --c: #b8232f; --bg: #fdf1f1; --bd: #f3d2d4; }
  .ntk-assure .is-box { --c: #c98a16; --bg: #fdf7ea; --bd: #f1e2bf; }
  .ntk-assure .is-mail { --c: #2f5fa8; --bg: #f1f5fc; --bd: #d6e1f3; }
  @media (max-width: 380px) {
    .ntk-assure li { padding: 10px 8px; gap: 8px; font-size: 12px; }
    .ntk-assure__ico { width: 32px; height: 32px; }
    .ntk-assure__ico svg { width: 17px; height: 17px; }
  }

  .ntk-details { width: 100%; margin: 18px 0 14px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(30, 58, 95, .16); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(30, 58, 95, .16); color: #1a1a1a; }
  .ntk-details summary { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 15px; min-height: 60px; padding: 17px 3px; cursor: pointer; list-style: none; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; }
  .ntk-details summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  .ntk-details summary::marker { content: ""; }
  .ntk-details summary:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid #1e3a5f; outline-offset: 3px; }
  .ntk-details__icon { position: relative; width: 18px; height: 18px; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .ntk-details__icon::before, .ntk-details__icon::after { content: ""; position: absolute; top: 50%; left: 50%; background: #1e3a5f; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); transition: transform .2s ease; }
  .ntk-details__icon::before { width: 16px; height: 1.5px; }
  .ntk-details__icon::after { width: 1.5px; height: 16px; }
  .ntk-details[open] .ntk-details__icon::after { transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(90deg); }
  .ntk-details__content { padding: 0 3px 22px; color: #3b3b3b; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.75; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .ntk-details__content img { display: block; max-width: 100%; height: auto; margin: 15px auto; }
  .ntk-details__content table { max-width: 100%; }
  @media (max-width: 749px) {
    .ntk-details summary { min-height: 54px; padding: 15px 2px; font-size: 15px; }
    .ntk-details__content { padding: 0 2px 18px; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.7; }
  }
</style>

<div class="ntk-info">
  <p><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 7h11v9H2z"/><path d="M13 10h4l3 3v3h-7z"/><circle cx="7" cy="17.5" r="1.7"/><circle cx="17" cy="17.5" r="1.7"/></svg><span><strong>Entrega en 3-5 días laborables</strong> tras la confirmación de tu pedido.</span></p>
  <p><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 12a8 8 0 0 1-11.6 7.1L4 20l1-4.6A8 8 0 1 1 21 12z"/></svg><span><strong>Confirmación en 24-72 h</strong> por WhatsApp o por teléfono. Asegúrate de que tu número esté disponible.</span></p>
</div>

{%- unless product.metafields.custom.nt_hide_region.value == true -%}
<p class="ntk-region">
  <strong>Envío solo a la España peninsular.</strong>
  Lo sentimos, no podemos realizar envíos a las Islas Baleares, las Islas Canarias, Ceuta ni Melilla.
</p>
{%- endunless -%}

<ul class="ntk-assure" aria-label="Proceso de compra">
  <li class="is-wa">
    <span class="ntk-assure__ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 12a8 8 0 0 1-11.6 7.1L4 20l1-4.6A8 8 0 1 1 21 12z"/></svg></span>
    <span class="ntk-assure__txt">Confirmación<small>WhatsApp o llamada</small></span>
  </li>
  <li class="is-cod">
    <span class="ntk-assure__ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="2.5" y="6" width="19" height="12" rx="2"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2.6"/><path d="M6 9.5v5M18 9.5v5"/></svg></span>
    <span class="ntk-assure__txt">Pago contra reembolso<small>Pagas al recibir</small></span>
  </li>
  <li class="is-box">
    <span class="ntk-assure__ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 7l9-4 9 4v10l-9 4-9-4V7z"/><path d="M3 7l9 4 9-4M12 11v10"/></svg></span>
    <span class="ntk-assure__txt">Comprueba el paquete<small>al recibirlo</small></span>
  </li>
  <li class="is-mail">
    <span class="ntk-assure__ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="M3 8l9 6 9-6"/></svg></span>
    <span class="ntk-assure__txt">Soporte<small>por email</small></span>
  </li>
</ul>

<details class="ntk-details" open>
  <summary>
    <span>Detalles del producto</span>
    <span class="ntk-details__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  </summary>
  <div class="ntk-details__content">
    {%- if product.metafields.custom.nt_info.value != blank -%}
      {{ product.metafields.custom.nt_info.value }}
    {%- elsif product.description != blank -%}
      {{ product.description }}
    {%- else -%}
      <p>La descripción de este producto estará disponible próximamente.</p>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
</details>
